{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53097","headline":"忆北府弟妹（二首） 二 · 殷济","name":"忆北府弟妹（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与尔俱成沦没世，艰难终日各东西。\n胡笳晓听心长共，汉月[宵]（霄）看意自迷。\n独泣空房襟上血，孤眠永夜梦中啼。\n何时骨肉园林会，不向天涯闻鼓鞞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}